    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "It's early in the morning, and the weather's cloudy."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g04_yaninn",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Along Yingfeng Road in Shangshu of Great Yan, sits an inn."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not many establishments would call themselves an inn in modern Yan."
    },
    {
        "text": "But this one has the most antique atmosphere, the finest wine and tea, and is the most cultured in all Shangshu."
    },
    {
        "text": "Its sign is red with gold lettering."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Xingyu.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Ten jars of Husong, three jars of Yunliao, six jars of Guixing reserve... hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Someone Innkeeper-esque"
    },
    {
        "text": "Liu, why are our numbers here so much lower than across the river?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Someone Innkeeper-esque"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame me! They went crazy with banquets at the start of the month. Of course they sold more than us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How much difference can a few parties make?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Someone Innkeeper-esque"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aiyo wei! You don't even know the half of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were out of Shangshu then. You don't know how ridiculous that hoo-hah was... Those two days of business could pay half a year's worth of bills, no exaggeration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were beating them for months, and those two days completely sunk us. You can't keep letting them make a fool of us, Mr. Zheng.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember, we were here first, and were the first to do it well. If you ask me the other places should be bowing to my old man here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be fooled into loving your grandkids while you forget your son here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you even blubbering about? Since when am I your old man? I haven't even said anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, and it'll be all over for me once you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was just bad luck. If I were the one to meet those nobles...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's just bad luck, then where's all your good luck to balance it out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah! Nobles, nobles, where did all those nobles come from...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always relied on word of mouth from our regulars, and you won't even do ads. If we could just invite a few pretty boys and girls to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Glare) ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You heard nothing. That was the wind just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Running a restaurant-inn depends on customers with taste and connections, true. But what do you know about who's connected and who isn't?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I knew, I'd be running the inn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then sit tight and learn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone with eyes can discern if someone rich, powerful, stylish, and wise, that's plain as day. So why can't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Erk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether you're a kung fu adventurer or a settled person, so long as you're alive you'll mingle with plenty of other people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "So keep mingling, and you'll get a good eye for this. Knowing people, and knowing what they know, is what lets us live well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Meanwhile, you spend all day fiddling about, and run off to the mahjong parlors every night. What kind of future do you expect when...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why'd you stop the lecture?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you see our two guests at the door?! Why aren't you greeting them?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aiyo... I completely missed them! Quick, quick, get them in! The first two customers of the day! Get them two plates of salted peanuts and a pot of chrysanthemum tea!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Might our luck be looking up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We are early. Let me treat you to dinner in Mr. Liang's stead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a seat! Tea will be with you in a moment!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought we'd have made a beeline for his residence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your 'friend' there is still a magistrate. Busy, in any case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Busy enough to overlook a friend? Must be busy as can be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sir, sir, what do you think, then? Are these two noble-types?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Pah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't ask, observe. You can't judge at first glance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
