    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Shangshu, where the winds blow high, and the clouds part to show off the moon.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The land was mountainous since times untold. Some would say the rugged terrain posed quite the obstacle to the nomadic city's development.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g05_mountaincity_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But the folk of Shangshu were loath to give up the land they'd dwelt in since antiquity, so they went to great pains to move mountains and fuse their city with the peaks.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Hence, unlike other cities, Shangshu's plates were distributed along the lines of the range, each perhaps hundreds or thousands of meters wide and utterly unique in their scenery.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g06_mountainroad_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How auspicious Shangshu's habitation must be that in recent years it has never once been struck by Catastrophe. Its people have built new towns in the mountains, and opened them up with ropeways and tunnels.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Furthermore, with the guidance of the Tumu Tianshi, a mountain range of particular renown was directly relocated onto the nomadic platforms, where...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Slow down mate, what's a Tumu... Tianshi? 'Heavenly Master of Earth and Wood'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You might be unaware, benefactor, but Yan has multiple bureaus of tianshi, Celestial Masters. Any student of the land even a mite accomplished at Originium Arts may apply to join, take layer upon layer of examination, and so serve the country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium Arts have a dizzying array of applications, and the science of Originium is developing by the day. The tianshi of Yan are naturally classified by profession and specialty\u2014civil engineers, for example! The artists of earth and wood indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And here I thought cool titles like that would be reserved for Casters like Leizi\u2014y'know, ones with crazy battle prowess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Would Leizi be that Yan official in Rhodes Island you mentioned before? My my, it may have been like that in the past, but times have changed. Now the welfare of the people comes first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium technology benefits the masses, and every tianshi of Yan's Ministry of Works pours their life's blood into researching Originium's Arts and testing new materials.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Other countries couldn't dream of moving whole mountains onto nomadic cities, that's for sure...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. While landscapes may soothe the soul, it certainly wouldn't be worth such monumental efforts if it broke the backs and the banks of the people in the process.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, most of the credit belongs to the civil engineers of the tianshi who loved their home enough to put in the work. And moving mountains was easy compared to convincing the local villages and estates to agree to the project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan has an old proverb. It's a land that raises its people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shame I can't speak much on Originium Arts, or else I'd have the same things on my mind as one of those nomadic city architects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is everyone from Yan like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's these rivers and hills before us, see\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fan",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "25_i09",
        "x": -10,
        "y": -10,
        "xScale": 1.3,
        "yScale": 1.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": -10,
        "yFrom": -10,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "xScaleTo": 0.83,
        "yScaleTo": 0.83,
        "duration": 40,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The limitless sights. Early springs so tranquil you can hear the snowflakes land. There's a lasting charm about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'd lived here since the cradle too, perhaps you'd think the same way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe. Who can say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew\u2014now that's refreshing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Where the winds blow high, and the clouds part to show off the moon.' I can see how it earned that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Within Shangshu lie the renowned 'Three Mounts and Seventeen Peaks,' and they draw plenty of tourists. Some foreign nobility even make the trip out here simply to admire them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Presumably the common folk owe it only to the pains of crossing the land that these landmarks aren't swarmed by such visitors coming in droves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a comfy breeze up here. I was worried it'd rain and delay us from heading up the mountains today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quite right, benefactor. The spring breeze caresses one's cheeks, the drizzle falls finely, all silent and slick in the rain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Been meaning to ask, actually. You're a martial artist, right? So how'd you get so... bookish?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "My master often instructed us that practicing the martial arts hardly precludes the study of culture. Indeed, the arts come both martial and cultural. To learn them well is but the duty of the modern soul.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, the art of gab can be a gateway to making some money.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor, what say we visit the nearest summit on the way? I hear more people have taken to the mountains these last two years; there's been quite the hubbub.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pass. We'll rest in the city for a day or two, wait for the sisters to meet up with us, and head on our way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* Never felt so bad about missing all the scenery on the way though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always been singularly devoted, benefactor. A mind only for the objective, not a whit more. And as proof of your conscientiousness, you never take a break.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never take breaks? Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever, flattery will get you nowhere. We're not going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, but you're merely taking me to the office for onboarding. Such a minor errand needn't be so urgent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "And did I not hear Lava mention you undertook this journey intending a vacation? Surely nothing impedes you from a good tour of the scenery then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g06_mountainroad_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "If only Lava were here... I'm not the only one who needs to sort out her head right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor Lava just happened to be tasked with a sudden commission taking her a different way\u2014I imagine she'll pass by scenery just as fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think she's the type to gawp at the view. Not in a million years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, so she isn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest though, she wasn't always this way. Me neither, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You needn't brood, benefactor. Things change, we change. The world's affairs are inconstant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's hurry on our way, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
