    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found them, Miss Du.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No mistake. They came in at Zhengshan Crossing, and got to Yingfeng Road in Weichang District. He got someone reliable to come with him the whole way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Lungmenite's carrying an antique little box on him, correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep. Clear as day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "If anything goes wrong, you're responsible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_303_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You left this to us. We won't let it go wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Good!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we're paying this buccaneer a visit in place of those yellow-bellied oldies!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
